/// Otherwise, it will only take effect in the current session.
/// (e.g. ~/.zshrc, ~/.zprofile, ~/.zshenv, ~/.bashrc, ~/.bash_profile, ~/.profile, ~/.config/fish/config.fish, or $PROFILE for powershell)
///
